d=\"bold-large\" style=\"color: #949494; font-size: 19px; font-weight: 700\">New arrivals</p>\n  <!-- Bold 18px is below 14pt: normal text, 3.03:1 fails. -->\n  <p id=\"bold-small\" style=\"color: #949494; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700\">Last chance</p>\n  <!-- Not rendered or visually hidden: no visible text, nothing to measure. -->\n  <p id=\"gone\" style=\"color: #cccccc; display: none\">Removed teaser</p>\n  <p id=\"invisible\" style=\"color: #cccccc; visibility: hidden\">Invisible teaser</p>\n  <p id=\"sr-text\" class=\"sr-only\" style=\"color: #cccccc\">Text for screen readers only</p>\n  <!-- Visible text under aria-hidden is still visible text (1.4.3). -->\n  <p id=\"decorative\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color: #aaaaaa\">Decorative tagline</p>\n  <!-- Dynamic: a script greys this text out after load. -->\n  <p id=\"late\">Offer valid while stocks last.</p>\n  <!-- Responsive: light grey only below 600px (the mobile pass). -->\n  <p id=\"narrow-only\">Free shipping from 50 euros.</p>\n</main>\n<footer><p>Footer text</p></footer>\n<script>\n  window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {\n    document.getElementById('late').style.color = '#aaaaaa';\n  });\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>"
